.DS_Store
build/
DerivedData/
# Xcode per-user state — must never be tracked. The old `*.xcuserdata/` pattern
# did NOT match the real `xcuserdata/` directory (it holds `<user>.xcuserdatad/`),
# so scheme/order churn kept surfacing in release diffs.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xcuserdata/
# Linux/FUSE artifact for a file rewritten while a handle was open. Not created by
# macOS; guards against accidentally committing one from a synced/mounted edit.
.fuse_hidden*
docs/*
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/BACKLOG.md
!docs/HANDOFF-SCHEMA.md
!docs/RELEASE-CHECKLIST.md
!docs/RELEASE-CHECKLIST-v2.1.md
!docs/ROADMAP.md
!docs/V2-INTEROP-PLAN.md
!docs/SEMANTIC-HTML-CONTRACT.md
